WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.580
If your prep is ClenPIQ, this video will walk you through exactly how to

2
00:00:03.580 --> 00:00:04.160
take it.

3
00:00:04.160 --> 00:00:06.400
Just follow along step by step.

4
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:10.320
Your ClenPIQ prep comes as two small ready-to-drink bottles.

5
00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:12.840
You'll drink each bottle straight.

6
00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:16.400
The day before your colonoscopy between 5 and 9 pm,

7
00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:20.160
you'll drink your first bottle of ClenPIQ right from the bottle.

8
00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:24.360
After you finish it, drink 5 cups of clear liquid over the next 3 to

9
00:00:24.360 --> 00:00:25.560
5 hours.

10
00:00:25.560 --> 00:00:29.960
Remember, no red, orange, blue, or purple liquids.

11
00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:33.640
For your second dose, 6 hours before your procedure time,

12
00:00:33.640 --> 00:00:36.080
drink your second bottle of ClenPIQ.

13
00:00:36.080 --> 00:00:41.600
After finishing it, drink 8 ounces of clear liquid every 15 minutes.

14
00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:45.360
This totals 32 ounces over 1 hour.

15
00:00:45.360 --> 00:00:47.960
If your procedure is scheduled for early morning,

16
00:00:47.960 --> 00:00:51.520
you will need to get up during the night to take this second dose.

17
00:00:51.520 --> 00:00:55.920
The correct timing of this dose is essential to an effective preparation.

18
00:00:55.920 --> 00:01:01.320
Do not have any liquids at all within 4 hours of your procedure.

19
00:01:01.320 --> 00:01:03.560
This part is really important.

20
00:01:03.560 --> 00:01:06.760
You must drink all of the prep solution as directed,

21
00:01:06.760 --> 00:01:09.280
even if you're already passing clear liquid.

22
00:01:09.280 --> 00:01:11.360
I know it can feel like enough,

23
00:01:11.360 --> 00:01:15.560
but finishing the entire dose is what gives us the clearest view during your

24
00:01:15.560 --> 00:01:17.040
procedure.

25
00:01:17.040 --> 00:01:21.080
If the prep isn't completed as directed, we may need to reschedule,

26
00:01:21.080 --> 00:01:23.080
and neither of us wants that.

27
00:01:23.080 --> 00:01:26.960
Drink as many clear liquids as possible throughout the process.

28
00:01:26.960 --> 00:01:30.360
Hydration is important, and it's actually part of the prep.

29
00:01:30.360 --> 00:01:32.880
Make sure to hydrate before you take the prep

30
00:01:32.880 --> 00:01:36.800
while you're taking the prep, but nothing after your second dose.

31
00:01:36.800 --> 00:01:40.440
If you experience any discomfort from frequent trips to the bathroom,

32
00:01:40.440 --> 00:01:45.360
applying a petroleum-based ointment or diaper rash cream can really help.

33
00:01:45.360 --> 00:01:47.720
That's it, you've got this.

34
00:01:47.720 --> 00:01:51.720
Follow the timing, finish the full dose, and stay hydrated.

35
00:01:51.720 --> 00:01:53.400
If you have any questions at all,

36
00:01:53.400 --> 00:01:55.600
don't hesitate to call our office.

37
00:01:55.600 --> 00:01:56.600
We're here to help.
